    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42102" root="وعث" body-key="w">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وعّث</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوْعِيثٌ</span>, <i>He withheld,</i> or <i>restrained, and turned,</i> or <i>diverted,</i> [another from
a thing]. (K.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وعّثهُ عَنْ كَذَا</span> <i>He turned him,</i>
or <i>diverted him, from such a thing;</i> as also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عوّثهُ</span>. (Az.)

